<title>JAPAN: Reuters average February Tapis assessed at $23.72.</title>
<headline>Reuters average February Tapis assessed at $23.72.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average Reuters price for Malaysian Tapis for February was $23.72.</p>
<p>Malaysia's Petronas uses Reuters morning quotes in its</p>
<p>monthly term crude formula. Reuters prices:</p>
<p>February 3  $25.40  12  $23.70  21  $23.25</p>
<p>		 4  $24.90  13  $23.73  24  $22.75</p>
<p>		 5  $24.90  14  $23.25  25  $22.58</p>
<p>		 6  $24.80  17  $23.60  26  $22.25</p>
<p>		 7  $24.85  18  $23.23  27  $22.50</p>
<p>		10  $24.85  19  $23.20  28  $22.70</p>
<p>		11  $24.85  20  $23.15</p>
</text>
